Data exclusion

This licence covers the code, SQL, configuration, documentation and aggregated
result tables in this repository only. It does not cover the market data the
analysis runs on: the Wind five-minute futures bars, and any file derived from
them at bar or daily grain (data/, marts/, the DuckDB warehouse and the Power BI
data cache). That data is licensed from its vendor, is not distributed with this
repository, and may not be redistributed. data/raw/MANIFEST.sha256 lists
checksums only, so that a user with their own licensed copy can verify it.
